<div class="mb-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">New API Client</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">
    Authorize a system to call the ZTLP-secured Bootstrap API. The
    HMAC secret itself lives in the per-zone secret store
    (<code class="font-mono">ZTLP_HMAC_SECRET_&lt;ZONE&gt;</code>) shared with the
    relay/gateway — this row is just the (zone, name) allowlist entry.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-lg p-6">
  <%= render "form", api_client: @api_client %>
</div>
